<x-layouts.app title="Help & guidance"><div class="page-container info-page"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE GUIDANCE</p><h1>Make the most of your study space.</h1><div class="panel padded"><h2>Find a useful chapter</h2><p>Search the library, choose a subject, or filter by resource type. Free notes can be read without an account. Sign in to save resources and track practice.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ route('library') }}">Explore the library →</a></div><div class="panel padded"><h2>How practice works</h2><p>Each question has one correct answer worth one mark. There is no negative marking. Your selected answers are saved to the server. Refreshing resumes the same active attempt, and the timer continues. Explanations become available after submission.</p><p>When your connection drops, the site shows an offline message. Wait for a saved confirmation before leaving the page. The deadline continues even when the browser is closed.</p></div><div class="panel padded"><h2>Report something that needs attention</h2><p>Use “Report a concern” on a resource page to flag incorrect content, privacy concerns or ownership issues. Your report goes to the administration review queue.</p></div><div class="panel padded"><h2>Current collection</h2><p>This first release includes original foundation notes and short objective practice sets. It does not claim complete syllabus coverage, guaranteed grades, or official board endorsement.</p></div></div></x-layouts.app>
